[0.8,"o","\u001b[H\r\u001b[6B\u001b[48;5;237m\u001b[38;5;246m❯ \u001b[38;5;231mPlease implement this issue.\u001b[39m                                                            \r\u001b[1B                                                                                          \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;5;231m#66 Which invoices are overdue\u001b[39m                                                          \r\u001b[1B                                                                                          \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;5;231mThe aging report tells me how much is overdue, but not which invoices, so I end up \u001b[39m     \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;5;231msearching the JSON file. Add \u001b[38;5;153m--details\u001b[38;5;231m to \u001b[38;5;153minvoicer aging\u001b[38;5;231m.\u001b[39m                               \r\u001b[1B                                                                                          \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;5;231mAcceptance criteria:\u001b[39m                                                                    \r\u001b[1B                                                                                          \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;5;231m1. With \u001b[38;5;153m--details\u001b[38;5;231m, each bucket's row is followed by its invoices, one per line: the \u001b[39m    \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;5;231minvoice's id, the customer's name, the due date, the days overdue and the amount.\u001b[39m       \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;5;231m2. Within a bucket, the invoice overdue the longest comes first.\u001b[39m                        \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;5;231m3. The amounts are the invoices' totals, printed as the report prints amounts, and they\u001b[39m \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;5;231madd up to the bucket's amount.\u001b[39m                                                          \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;5;231m4. Without \u001b[38;5;153m--details\u001b[38;5;231m, \u001b[38;5;153minvoicer aging\u001b[38;5;231m prints exactly what it prints today.\u001b[39m               \r\u001b[8B\u001b[49m\u001b[38;5;174m✶\u001b[3GMe\u001b[38;5;216mtam\u001b[38;5;174morphosing… \r\u001b[3B\u001b[38;5;246m❯ \u001b[39m\u001b[7m \u001b[27m\u001b[K\u001b[34;1H\u001b[32;3H"]
[1.689,"o","\u001b[H\r\u001b[22B\u001b[38;5;231m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mI'll\u001b[8Gstart\u001b[14Gby\u001b[17Gexploring\u001b[27Gthe\u001b[31Gcodebase\u001b[40Gto\u001b[43Gunderstand\u001b[54Gthe\u001b[58Gexisting\u001b[67Gaging\u001b[73Greport.\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;5;246m \u001b[3G\u001b[39mListing\u001b[11Gsource\u001b[18Gand\u001b[22Gtesting\u001b[30Gfiles,\u001b[37Gshowing\u001b[45Gpackage.json\r\u001b[4B\u001b[38;5;174m·\u001b[3G\u001b[38;5;180mEnchanting…\u001b[38;5;174m \u001b[38;5;246m(2s · ↓\u001b[23G67 tokens)\u001b[39m\u001b[34;1H\u001b[32;3H"]
